#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:3
#: c5f8a812013b47e2bff4f4237324b4eb
msgid "Solvent Box Fill"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:5
#: e7b6809ba879424d9ae1a4c09f00d5df
msgid "`Group`: `Organic` | `Class`: `SolventBoxFillCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:7
#: bc1cf293479749b884eefe46f7dce940
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:9
#: f660c4e25ca64235bdeed13c74a3eef7
msgid ""
"`Solvent Box Fill` 在已有周期性晶胞中插入溶剂分子，适合从干结构或稀疏溶剂结构生成整盒溶剂候选初态。输入结构必须有非奇异 "
"cell，并且至少一个周期方向开启。"
msgstr ""
"`Solvent Box Fill` inserts solvent molecules into an existing periodic cell "
"to create a full-box candidate from a dry or sparsely solvated structure. "
"Input needs a nonsingular cell and at least one periodic direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:11
#: 05f0ccc181d54a88b05ce5b35eb4e457
msgid "它解决的是“训练集缺少周期溶剂环境”的覆盖问题，不替代分子动力学平衡或量化优化。输出仍需要做几何筛查和后续 DFT/MD 处理。"
msgstr ""
"It addresses missing periodic solvent environments; it does not replace MD "
"equilibration or quantum optimization. Output still requires geometry checks"
" and downstream DFT/MD treatment."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:13
#: 0ca17b35f7bd4361ab778e1fc6c0910e
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:15
#: 80d1e1e6ad8e40df917e7e40f515e22d
msgid "场景：模型只见过真空表面，没有见过周期溶剂盒"
msgstr "Scenario: The model has seen vacuum surfaces but no periodic solvent box"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:17
#: dd1b5ae9ee1d4af4957aac3af1c1dd3d
msgid ""
"你要训练一个界面或溶液体系的 NEP，但已有训练集主要是干表面和单分子吸附构型。先准备带 cell 的周期输入结构，用 `Solvent Box "
"Fill` 插入固定数量或按密度估算的水分子，生成一批整盒初态。"
msgstr ""
"For an interface or solution NEP whose data are mostly dry surfaces and "
"single adsorbates, begin from a periodic cell and insert a fixed or density-"
"estimated solvent count to propose full-box initial states."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:19
#: dd8579c719264332843818f6e5a5277e
msgid ""
"参数设置：`count_mode=\"fixed\"`，`solvent_count=200`，`sampling_mode=\"auto\"`，`min_distance=0.8`，`max_attempts_per_solvent=500`，打开"
" `use_seed`。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters: `count_mode=\"fixed\"`, `solvent_count=200`, "
"`sampling_mode=\"auto\"`, `min_distance=0.8`, "
"`max_attempts_per_solvent=500`, and `use_seed` enabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:21
#: c6922ea6ef90426c91e5654f2d432bb5
msgid "检查输出时重点看是否插满、是否存在明显短接触、溶剂是否都包回 cell 内，以及后续预松弛是否大面积崩坏。"
msgstr ""
"Check whether the target count was reached, short contacts exist, molecules "
"lie within the periodic cell, and pre-relaxation remains stable."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:23
#: d566d867b6654c7eb947530655544f77
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:25
#: da50acb171674170a1fd63bc84586702
msgid "溶剂输入"
msgstr "Solvent input"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:27
#: b7350068561347e1ba31a6ca734081e6
msgid "Solvent XYZ（solvent_xyz）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:29
#: 1391adb51bbe476aa7dfab841a9920b7
msgid "`str`，默认是一个三原子水分子 XYZ。这里保存溶剂分子文本，而不是文件路径。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default a three-atom water XYZ block. Stores molecule text, not a "
"path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:31
#: 6eb222480977433a9bcba02d1a03870c
msgid "Structures（structures）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:33
#: 2dd3f2ba75a44353925040761843ec0e
msgid "`int`，默认 1。每个输入结构生成多少个独立填充版本。"
msgstr "`int`, default `1`. Independent box-fill variants per input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:35
#: e82b3eb9ee564604924c4a546347ae80
msgid "数量控制"
msgstr "Count control"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:37
#: d7a29174fddf40a68050370283d45d56
msgid "Count Mode（count_mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:39
#: cc9c2bf4560a4c8a876e4c6338afa50a
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `fixed`。可选 `fixed`、`density`。`fixed` 直接使用 `solvent_count`；`density`"
" 根据 cell 体积、溶剂分子质量、`density` 和 `fill_packing` 估算数量。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `fixed`. `fixed` uses `solvent_count`; `density` estimates "
"count from cell volume, molecule mass, `density`, and `fill_packing`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:41
#: 87b2b77e62144b66b555d37db81a710b
msgid "Solvent Count（solvent_count）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:43
#: e518dff3f8ff44739b44c1e00cc33baa
msgid "`int`，默认 100。`count_mode=\"fixed\"` 时生效。"
msgstr "`int`, default `100`; fixed mode only."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:45
#: 78274b2460d04b47bf196f271ba5343b
msgid "Density（density）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:47
#: c1e169ca092d46d0a0ba7f91252571a5
msgid "`float`，默认 1.0，单位 g/cm³。`count_mode=\"density\"` 时用于估算溶剂分子数量。"
msgstr "`float`, default `1.0` g/cm³; density mode only."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:49
#: 6c72ae05db1449a19a97e9939a4126e0
msgid "Fill Packing（fill_packing）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:51
#: d95d0e21167a494d9c12a98484603a68
msgid "`float`，默认 1.0。`count_mode=\"density\"` 时作为密度缩放因子；小于 1 会降低目标分子数。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `1.0`. Packing multiplier for density-based count; values "
"below 1 reduce the target."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:53
#: 4f4c950e76654cf6a4a3fe63bc263144
msgid "采样和几何约束"
msgstr "Sampling and geometry constraints"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:55
#: dc81c26789de40dba214ab722bf557e1
msgid "Sampling Mode（sampling_mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:57
#: 7fc4113ff3764278aa31d5ac6f388730
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `auto`。可选 "
"`auto`、`general`、`water`、`loose`、`dense`。整盒填充不会因为盒子里有离子就自动切到 `ion-"
"water`，因为它没有局部中心原子。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `auto`. Options are `auto`, `general`, `water`, `loose`, and "
"`dense`. Full-box filling has no local center and therefore does not "
"automatically select `ion-water`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:59
#: decadd875b2847adb3838491d79db837
msgid "Min Distance（min_distance）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:61
#: c9eb3e1b97134c0d9273b769f85d0f58
msgid "`float`，默认 0。大于 0 时作为全局原子-原子最小距离；等于 0 时使用元素碰撞半径和 `collision_scale`。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0`. A positive value is the global minimum atom-atom "
"distance. At `0`, element-specific collision radii scaled by "
"`collision_scale` are used."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:63
#: f5a13cfe4f104d539a7222ab30ace8bc
msgid "Collision Scale（collision_scale）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:65
#: f3ea45bb9a7046e593b4736e20e50531
msgid "`float`，默认 0。等于 0 时使用 `sampling_mode` 的内置半径缩放；大于 0 时覆盖模式默认值。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0`. Zero uses the mode's collision scaling; a positive "
"value overrides it as minimum distance."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:67
#: 1df5d078c7e14da6a0b2c191591c84f2
msgid "Max Attempts Per Solvent（max_attempts_per_solvent）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:69
#: dd8b38870aa84a1ca2be8423e0d2d560
msgid "`int`，默认 500。每个目标溶剂分子的最大随机放置尝试次数。高密度盒子触顶时，优先检查目标数量和 `min_distance`，再考虑增加它。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `500`. Placement attempts per requested molecule. At high "
"density, check count and collision distances before increasing it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:71
#: a6451a2e7561462b94acbb1d7c2492ee
msgid "Strict Count（strict_count）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:73
#: f8a345f3c39a46f1ba377e0aa15eae7c
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。打开后，未插满目标数量就失败；关闭后允许输出部分填充结果。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. Fail unless the target count is reached; disabled "
"permits partial fill."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:75
#: 7b87230cd61c483ca92d9ec0817b7e4d
msgid "柔性溶剂"
msgstr "Flexible solvent molecules"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:77
#: 8281dc63e56942d3bdc3e46250cb3d33
msgid "Flex Solvent（flex_solvent）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:79
#: ba9c49b733e241768245cd88c2cfaef2
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后复用仓库已有 torsion-guard core 生成溶剂构象池，再用于填盒。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Generate a solvent conformer pool with torsion-"
"guard before filling."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:81
#: da291e38d14a470d92b0a72e3571f26c
msgid "Flex Pool（flex_pool）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:83
#: bdc099cd3c644ec0bc2bd87a69d01d1d
msgid "`int`，默认 32。柔性溶剂构象池大小。"
msgstr "`int`, default `32`. Size of the conformer pool for a flexible solvent."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:85
#: 6377b4e559b546b2b75a2e546df75bcf
msgid "Flex Torsion Range（flex_torsion_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:87
#: 726ae1ab99aa4f25ab4e3f6f44fe1212
msgid "`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(-180.0, 180.0)`，单位 degree。柔性构象生成时的扭转角范围。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float]`, default `(-180.0, 180.0)` degrees. Torsion-angle "
"range used to generate flexible conformers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:89
#: 37b82cdb521f4b86bbc8f2a0a787e966
msgid "Flex Max Torsions（flex_max_torsions）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:91
#: c9da4eaa618c4458bb76902b472d5947
msgid "`int`，默认 5。每个柔性构象最多扰动多少个可旋转键。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `5`. Maximum number of rotatable bonds perturbed in each "
"flexible conformer."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:93
#: 6c64dc2a83ce4369b4b409618549e455
msgid "Flex Gaussian Sigma（flex_gaussian_sigma）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:95
#: 94f7f9771f0c4d2981d26bcf6ebb8ec0
msgid "`float`，默认 0.03，单位 Å。柔性构象生成时叠加的坐标噪声。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.03` Å. Coordinate noise added while generating flexible "
"conformers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:97
#: 6481343cefa24e9784129e38f6568224
msgid "随机性"
msgstr "Randomness"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:99
#: b04fca2410974ff195b456ccd5234bb0
msgid "Use Seed（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:101
#: e54a0d9ccf7b4fbf853e80be4198a09d
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后，同一输入结构、参数和 seed 会生成相同输出。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. When enabled, identical input, parameters, and seed"
" produce identical output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:103
#: 9243c528da6d4afba9dba2241eb8b831
msgid "Seed（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:105
#: 4235ef35ea244a468271b91d59b0fa7f
msgid "`int`，默认 0。`use_seed=True` 时生效。"
msgstr "`int`, default `0`. Used when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:107
#: be9193e70e2c4779bb30d2f8c2e4f101
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:109
#: 2ca0af3fbf7b45929d9ed7f17277def3
msgid "固定数量水盒（200 个水，固定 seed）"
msgstr "Fixed-count water box (200 waters, fixed seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:111
#: ba2467fa545d4e1594b9f7766b3a2bd1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"Solvent Box Fill\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"structures\": 1,\n"
"    \"count_mode\": \"fixed\",\n"
"    \"solvent_count\": 200,\n"
"    \"sampling_mode\": \"auto\",\n"
"    \"min_distance\": 0.8,\n"
"    \"max_attempts_per_solvent\": 500,\n"
"    \"strict_count\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:129
#: f979e648387f4f11a2f7c936896d8fc6
msgid "按密度填充水盒（允许部分输出）"
msgstr "Density-based water box (partial output allowed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:131
#: 0c1562dc35e840849df3dc95254e98de
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"Solvent Box Fill\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"structures\": 3,\n"
"    \"count_mode\": \"density\",\n"
"    \"density\": 1.0,\n"
"    \"fill_packing\": 0.7,\n"
"    \"sampling_mode\": \"water\",\n"
"    \"min_distance\": 0.85,\n"
"    \"max_attempts_per_solvent\": 800,\n"
"    \"strict_count\": false,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 7\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:150
#: 29eea05daf4d410a8ada57819187e94b
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:152
#: a8374cd94da742b28d4573c1bc9e1800
msgid "`Solvent Box Fill → Geometry Filter`：先剔除短接触和明显异常盒子。"
msgstr ""
"`Solvent Box Fill` -> `Geometry Filter`: reject short contacts and abnormal "
"boxes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:153
#: c54497ccfcba4048a7998265110a24c5
msgid "`Solvent Box Fill → FPS Filter`：整盒初态很多时，用代表性采样降低 DFT 数量。"
msgstr ""
"`Solvent Box Fill` -> `FPS Filter`: reduce many initial boxes to "
"representative DFT candidates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:155
#: 6e72c8c167d84602b689132b0961fb76
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:157
#: 3f778311b0ca4257b927c2c2cd176758
msgid "输入没有有效周期 cell：这张卡需要非奇异 cell 和至少一个周期方向；非周期局部溶剂环境请用 `Local Solvation`。"
msgstr ""
"No valid periodic cell: use a nonsingular cell with periodicity, or choose "
"`Local Solvation` for a nonperiodic local environment."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:158
#: c3a41c4c74204597a5ef602c6dd90059
msgid ""
"无法插满目标数量：降低 `solvent_count` 或 `fill_packing`，减小 `min_distance` 或 "
"`collision_scale`，增大 cell；也可以关闭 `strict_count` 先保留部分可用候选。"
msgstr ""
"Cannot reach the target: reduce count/packing, revise collision limits, "
"enlarge the cell, or disable `strict_count` to retain partial candidates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:159
#: 2834ba483d544277aeb6f572fc39a683
msgid ""
"按密度估算的数量不符合预期：数量由 cell 体积、溶剂分子质量、`density` 和 `fill_packing` 共同决定，先检查 cell "
"单位、真空层和 `solvent_xyz` 是否正确。"
msgstr ""
"Unexpected density-based count: verify cell units, vacuum volume, solvent "
"mass/text, density, and packing factor."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:161
#: 5b756fb51d3441f6b7a412409db2dbd1
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:163
#: 0f5f42080ae747708d9e4af2ee1d32d6
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`SolvBox(mode={mode},n={placed})`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:165
#: fc746205db1a4ce18f7b426f5836673a
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:167
#: b5258263fba34a39927dbdb16ea29d21
msgid ""
"打开 `use_seed` 后，相同输入结构、结构顺序、参数和 `seed` 会生成相同填盒结果。`count_mode=\"density\"` "
"时，cell 体积或 `solvent_xyz` 改变会改变目标分子数，因此输出也会改变。"
msgstr ""
"With `use_seed`, identical input, order, parameters, and seed reproduce "
"filling. In density mode, changing cell volume or solvent text changes the "
"target count and output."
